+An actual storage allocation refusal exercises the production BudgetExceeded-to-request
+overload conversion; other storage codes and invariant errors retain their exception identity.
+These checks prove the host ownership primitives; native state restoration and continued
+service of peer requests additionally require the real Engine regression workload.
